# Golden docs

> Everything an agent should read first.

## Rules

- [Always](../.ai-rulez/rules/always.md): Always apply this rule.
- [Migrations](../.ai-rulez/rules/auto.md): Database migrations
- [Manual](../.ai-rulez/rules/manual.md): Only when asked.
- [Targeted](../.ai-rulez/rules/targeted.md): For claude and cursor only.
- [TypeScript](../.ai-rulez/rules/typescript.md): Use strict mode.

## Context

- [Architecture](../.ai-rulez/context/architecture.md): Layers and boundaries.
- [Overview](../.ai-rulez/context/overview.md): The project overview.

## Skills

- [Deployer](../.ai-rulez/skills/deployer/SKILL.md): Deploys the service
- [Reviewer](../.ai-rulez/skills/reviewer/SKILL.md): Reviews pull requests

## Optional

- [Architect](../.ai-rulez/agents/architect.md): Designs systems
- [Tester](../.ai-rulez/agents/tester.md): Writes tests

## Optional

- [build](../.ai-rulez/commands/build.md): Build the project
- [ship](../.ai-rulez/commands/ship.md): Ship a release
